WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS

This MIT license applies to the code in this repository: the training scripts,
the quantization implementation, the scrapers, the website, and the synthetic
data generator in data/sources/persona.py.

It does NOT and cannot apply to:

  * The scraped corpus. data/raw/ contains Twitch chat messages, Reddit
    comments, YouTube transcripts and song lyrics written by other people. That
    text belongs to whoever wrote it. It is collected here for a personal
    research experiment; it is not mine to license, and it is redistributed on
    Hugging Face for reproducibility only.

  * GPT-2. The fine-tuned model derives from GPT-2, released by OpenAI under
    the MIT license. The base model's weights and its ability to write English
    came from them.

  * Third-party dependencies, each under its own license: PyTorch,
    transformers, ONNX Runtime, transformers.js, Next.js, yt-dlp.

If you plan to use the corpus or the fine-tuned model commercially, look into
the licensing of the underlying source material first. This project does not
grant you rights it does not hold.
